{{!
    @template paygw_mercadopago/pay_invoice

    O QR code do Pix ou a linha digitavel do boleto - a fatura de um ciclo
    que o aluno ainda nao pagou. Mostrado em return.php, porque esta pagina
    e NOSSA: diferente do Checkout Pro, o aluno nunca viu isto no Mercado
    Pago antes de chegar aqui.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * pix bool
    * boleto bool
    * qrcode string
    * qrcodeimage string
    * barcode string
    * ticketurl string
    * waitingmessage string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pix": true,
        "boleto": false,
        "qrcode": "00020126...",
        "qrcodeimage": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0K...",
        "barcode": "",
        "ticketurl": "https://www.mercadopago.com.br/payments/123/ticket",
        "waitingmessage": "Esperando o pagamento."
    }
}}
<div class="paygw-mercadopago-invoice text-center">
    {{#pix}}
        {{#qrcodeimage}}
            <img src="{{qrcodeimage}}" alt="" class="img-fluid mb-3" style="max-width: 260px;">
        {{/qrcodeimage}}
        {{#qrcode}}
            <div class="input-group mb-3">
                <input type="text" class="form-control" readonly value="{{qrcode}}">
            </div>
        {{/qrcode}}
    {{/pix}}

    {{#boleto}}
        {{#barcode}}
            <p class="font-monospace">{{barcode}}</p>
        {{/barcode}}
    {{/boleto}}

    {{#ticketurl}}
        <p><a href="{{ticketurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
            {{#str}} subscribeviewboleto, paygw_mercadopago {{/str}}
        </a></p>
    {{/ticketurl}}

    <p class="text-muted small">{{waitingmessage}}</p>
</div>
